      1.26580436D-01         1.0
P    1   1.00
      2.53817535D+05         1.0
P    1   1.00
      3.74699676D+04         1.0
P    1   1.00
      8.54270467D+03         1.0
P    1   1.00
      2.54055332D+03         1.0
P    1   1.00
      9.00086660D+02         1.0
P    1   1.00
      3.58408502D+02         1.0
P    1   1.00
      1.54196337D+02         1.0
