      1.13965453D-01         1.0
D    1   1.00
      1.80142819D+03         1.0
D    1   1.00
      5.10725112D+02         1.0
D    1   1.00
      1.91813939D+02         1.0
D    1   1.00
      8.20523022D+01         1.0
